# A note typed into its field (found by its placeholder), the Add button
# enabled once there's text, the keyboard put away, the note added and
# swiped away.
assert disabled Add
type Water the plants into New note
assert value New note = Water the plants
assert enabled Add
hidekeyboard
tap Add
see Water the plants
assert value New note =
swipe left on Water the plants
tap Delete
notsee Water the plants
